   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "The golden rule: V2",
   "texto": "In a **oración principal afirmativa**, the conjugated verb usually occupies the second position. If another part of the sentence appears in front, the subject goes behind the verb:\n\n- **Jeg** bor her. → Her **bor jeg**.\n- **Det** regnede i går. → I går **regnede det**.\n\nThe rule describes the position of the verb within the main prayer; the subordinates have another order.",
